        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಮಾಳಿಗೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಳಿಗೆ — māḷige — \"an upper storey; a flat roof\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಕ್ಕಳು ಮಾಳಿಗೆಯ ಮೇಲೆ ಗಾಳಿಪಟ ಹಾರಿಸಿದರು. makkaḷu māḷigeya mēle gāḷipaṭa hārisidaru. The children flew kites on the roof."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಳಿಗೆ (māḷige) ಮನೆ, a house with an upper floor."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಳಿಗೆ (māḷige) is native Dravidian: DEDR 4796 lists Kannada māḍa, māḷa and māḷige, \"a large building, an upstair house\"."
            }
          ]
        },
