              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅತಿಥಿ ಹೊಸ್ತಿಲು ದಾಟಿ ಒಳಗೆ ಬಂದರು. atithi hostilu dāṭi oḷage bandaru. The guest stepped over the threshold and came in."
            },
